<header><p class="enc-kicker">Event · disaster</p><h1 class="enc-title">Cyclone Nargis</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/2008">2008</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/21st-century">21st century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Cyclone Nargis was a tropical cyclone that struck Myanmar on 2–3 May 2008, driving a storm surge across the Irrawaddy delta. About 138,000 people were killed or went missing, the worst natural disaster in the country's recorded history. The military government at first restricted foreign aid and relief workers, and held its constitutional referendum days later.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/cyclone-nargis.jpg" alt="Cyclone Nargis" width="320" height="411" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: NASA · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nargis_2008-05-02_0645Z.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
